title: Outer Rim Affairs
subtitle: Relief, piracy, slavery and representation for the Rim.
is-card: true
tags: senate_affairs
card-image: img/card_rim.svg
view-if: rimaffairs_timer <= 0 and chair_rimaffairs = "rc" and cardok_rimaffairs
on-arrival: turn_actions += 1; rimaffairs_timer = 3; last_card_timer = "rimaffairs"
new-page: true

= Outer Rim Affairs Committee

The Caucus chairs the Outer Rim Affairs Committee. Hardship on the Rim is [+ rim_hardship : level +].

- @relief: Launch a Rim relief programme.
- @piracy: Fund anti-piracy patrols.
- @abolition: Abolish slavery in Hutt space.
- @enfranchise: Pass the Rim Enfranchisement Act.
- @hearings: Hold committee hearings on the Rim.
- @easy_discard

@relief
view-if: rim_hardship > 15
subtitle: −2 treasury. A lasting reduction in Rim hardship.
choose-if: treasury >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: The treasury cannot afford it.
on-arrival: treasury -= 2; rim_relief += 1; rim_hardship -= 4; outer_sep -= 2; rim_relation += 3

The Rim Relief Programme funds clinics, shipyards and grain ships for a hundred worlds.

@piracy
view-if: rim_hardship > 20 and not war
subtitle: −1 treasury. Less hardship; the Security Bloc approves.
choose-if: treasury >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The treasury cannot afford it.
on-arrival: treasury -= 1; rim_hardship -= 2; sec_relation += 3; judicial_forces += 0.2

Judicial patrol frigates begin escorting convoys through the Rim's worst lanes.

@abolition
view-if: not slavery_abolished and slavery_campaign >= 1
subtitle: −1 political capital. A historic act. The Hutts will retaliate.
choose-if: capital >= 1 and rc_in_govt
unavailable-subtitle: Needs 1 political capital and a seat in government.
on-arrival: {!
Q.capital -= 1;
var st = SW.stance(Q, {mod: 0.6, guild: 0.3, rim: 0.7, sec: 0.45, ind: 0.45, pal: 0.4, cis: 0.2}, true);
st.rim += Q.slavery_campaign * 0.05; st.mod += Q.slavery_campaign * 0.05;
Q.ab_vote = SW.vote(Q, st, 1);
Q.vote_html = SW.voteBanner('Abolition of Slavery Act', Q.ab_vote);
if (Q.ab_vote >= 50) { Q.slavery_abolished = 1; Q.rim_hardship += 2; Q.rim_relation += 6; Q.faith += 2; this.achieve('abolition'); }
!}

[+ vote_html +]

[? if slavery_abolished : Slavery is outlawed throughout the Republic and its client territories, Hutt space included. The cartels respond with raids and blockades, but slave markets from Tatooine to Nar Shaddaa begin to empty. ?][? if not slavery_abolished : The Hutts' friends in the Senate quietly kill the bill. ?]

@enfranchise
view-if: not rim_enfranchised
subtitle: −2 political capital. Full representation for the Rim: a lasting cure for separatism, if it passes.
choose-if: capital >= 2 and rc_in_govt
unavailable-subtitle: Needs 2 political capital and a seat in government.
on-arrival: {!
Q.capital -= 2;
var st = SW.stance(Q, {mod: 0.35, guild: 0.25, rim: 0.95, sec: 0.2, ind: 0.6, pal: 0.35, cis: 0.7}, true);
Q.en_vote = SW.vote(Q, st, 1);
Q.vote_html = SW.voteBanner('Rim Enfranchisement Act', Q.en_vote);
if (Q.en_vote >= 50) { Q.rim_enfranchised = 1; Q.outer_sep -= 10; Q.midrim_sep -= 6; Q.rim_relation += 10; Q.mod_relation -= 5; Q.outer_rc += 3; this.achieve('enfranchised'); }
!}

[+ vote_html +]

[? if rim_enfranchised : Outer Rim sectors gain the delegations their populations deserve, and seats on every major committee. For the first time in centuries, the Rim has a real voice in the Republic. ?][? if not rim_enfranchised : The Core will not share power. The Rim takes note. ?]

@hearings
subtitle: Free. The Rim is heard; builds the case for abolition.
on-arrival: rim_relation += 3; outer_sep -= 1; slavery_campaign += 0.3

Rim witnesses testify before the committee. Their stories make the news.
